Tracker with updates on federal developments in AI and skilled trades. Includes House, Senate and Canadian Gazette developments (the Gazette is where federal regulations are published, https://gazette.gc.ca/accueil-home-eng.html)

Live site: https://tonhs.github.io/AI-Skilled-Trades-Federal/

- index.html      the page (built by build.py; do not edit by hand)
- template.html   page design and rendering
- collect.py      gathers items from Parliament, the Senate and the Gazette
- build.py        builds index.html from the data
- data/           everything found, plus the summaries and ratings
- CLAUDE.md       the update routine Claude follows when refreshing the tracker

AI-generated and mostly correct with occasional mistakes. Links are included for easy verification.
